---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import BentoTile from './BentoTile.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="ABOUT" title="The short version" />

    <div class="bento">
      <BentoTile span={4}>
        <div class="stack stack-5">
          <h3 class="h3">From wanting to be an inventor to building products</h3>
          <div class="stack stack-4">
            <p>
              I wanted to be an inventor before I knew what code was. That itch never left: find a problem, build the thing that fixes it. Code turned out to be the best set of tools I'd ever found for that.
            </p>
            <p>
              I think of myself as a product engineer more than a programmer. A clever backend that nobody enjoys using is only half-built. I gravitate toward work where the interface feels considered and modern, not just functional.
            </p>
            <p>
              And I can't walk past a bug. If I spot one, it gets fixed, usually before anyone asks. That part isn't up for debate.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </BentoTile>

      <BentoTile span={2} accent="2" stripe>
        <div class="stack stack-5">
          <h3 class="h3">At a glance</h3>
          <div class="stack stack-5">
            <div class="stack stack-2">
              <p class="mono muted">Education</p>
              <p>BSc Computer Science with AI, University of Nottingham</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stack stack-2">
              <p class="mono muted">Focus</p>
              <p>Full-stack products &amp; AI tooling</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stack stack-2">
              <p class="mono muted">Lately</p>
              <p>Infrastructure (Terraform/AWS) &amp; agentic coding</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stack stack-2">
              <p class="mono muted">Off the clock</p>
              <p>Anime, games, and the gym</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </BentoTile>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
